  "instructions": [
    "In a bowl mix flour, yeast, salt, sugar and oregano.",
    "Add warm water and olive oil and stir until dough forms.",
    "Knead dough on lightly floured surface for 8 minutes until smooth.",
    "Place dough in greased bowl, cover with damp cloth, let rise 30 minutes until doubled.",
    "Preheat yakimono grill to medium heat.",
    "Punch down dough, roll into 10 thin circles on parchment.",
    "Spread each circle with chopped onion, minced garlic and a pinch of paprika.",
    "Cook on grill 3-4 minutes per side until golden and cooked through."
